Wait, that was sick.

2951
02:45:43,950 --> 02:45:44,310
That was sick.

2952
02:45:44,630 --> 02:45:44,670
That was sick.

2953
02:45:44,670 --> 02:45:45,710
The way I just blocked that.

2954
02:45:48,330 --> 02:45:48,930
Hey!

2955
02:45:49,610 --> 02:45:49,970
