4566
04:04:11,070 --> 04:04:11,970
Raw food.

4567
04:04:14,010 --> 04:04:14,930
Go up here.

4568
04:04:15,710 --> 04:04:16,270
Blaze rod.

4569
04:04:16,510 --> 04:04:16,830
All this.

4570
04:04:16,830 --> 04:04:17,630
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

4571
04:04:17,890 --> 04:04:18,310
Feather.

4572
04:04:19,270 --> 04:04:19,830
There.

4573
04:04:20,030 --> 04:04:20,550
