Can I hold shift and sort of drag?

4588
04:05:02,840 --> 04:05:02,920
No.

4589
04:05:05,040 --> 04:05:05,580
Yeah.

4590
04:05:06,660 --> 04:05:07,900
Eggs, though, don't belong here.

4591
04:05:09,260 --> 04:05:10,620
