Guys, what do you say about me predicting what's inside the nether both times I go through the portal?

4606
04:06:02,820 --> 04:06:04,500
Tell me that wasn't insane.

4607
04:06:07,940 --> 04:06:09,160
Bundles is freedom.

4608
04:06:09,500 --> 04:06:10,060
It is.

4609
04:06:10,520 --> 04:06:12,300
I love the bundles, man.

4610
04:06:12,780 --> 04:06:13,640
The bundles.

4611
04:06:15,520 --> 04:06:16,860
It was insane.

4612
04:06:17,340 --> 04:06:18,460
You're a god.

4613
04:06:20,160 --> 04:06:21,640
Pre-watched.

4614
04:06:25,760 --> 04:06:26,940
Bundles of joy.

4615
04:06:26,940 --> 04:06:27,460
Yeah.

4616
04:06:28,300 --> 04:06:29,300
You could say that.

4617
04:06:31,740 --> 04:06:33,280
Since you asked, it wasn't insane.

4618
04:06:33,480 --> 04:06:33,740
Aw.

4619
04:06:34,260 --> 04:06:34,620
Okay.

4620
04:06:36,040 --> 04:06:37,520
You should check out what the prediction was.

4621
04:06:37,600 --> 04:06:38,020
Okay, hold on.

4622
