4623
04:06:43,900 --> 04:06:44,540
Prediction time.

4624
04:06:44,660 --> 04:06:45,040
Let's see here.

4625
04:06:47,080 --> 04:06:47,520
Wait.

4626
04:06:47,720 --> 04:06:47,920
Wait.

4627
04:06:47,920 --> 04:06:49,080
You already finished it, though.

4628
04:06:53,730 --> 04:06:54,650
Who will win?

4629
04:06:54,770 --> 04:06:55,770
Oliver or the fly?

4630
04:06:56,930 --> 04:06:58,190
Oh my god.

4631
04:07:00,050 --> 04:07:01,690
