4637
04:07:16,310 --> 04:07:18,350
You open the window and they're like...

4638
04:07:18,350 --> 04:07:19,150
They don't want to leave.

4639
04:07:21,490 --> 04:07:22,330
Bastard fly.

4640
04:07:27,960 --> 04:07:28,860
I like it.

4641
04:07:28,860 --> 04:07:30,240
I like that you've run these predictions.

4642
04:07:30,420 --> 04:07:30,980
That's really fun.

4643
04:07:34,400 --> 04:07:35,100
By the way...

4644
04:07:36,060 --> 04:07:36,460
Swindig!

4645
04:07:37,220 --> 04:07:38,520
It's been four hours ago.

4646
04:07:39,000 --> 04:07:40,460
Thanks for subscribing with Prime.

4647
04:07:40,640 --> 04:07:41,340
Also, Shmeev!

4648
04:07:42,600 --> 04:07:43,780
Thank you for subbing, man.

4649
04:07:44,160 --> 04:07:46,040
And thank you for the Deadlock games.

4650
04:07:46,640 --> 04:07:48,020
We're gonna play some more in the future.

4651
04:07:49,280 --> 04:07:52,260
By the way, for the people that are interested in playing Deadlock...

4652
04:07:52,820 --> 04:07:56,800
I usually post in the Looking for Group channel on the Discord when I'm running some games.

4653
04:07:57,720 --> 04:07:58,860
Feel free to join for that.

4654
04:07:59,460 --> 04:08:00,460
The more, the merrier.

4655
04:08:03,340 --> 04:08:04,360
You'll get it next time?

4656
04:08:04,560 --> 04:08:04,860
Thank you.

4657
04:08:05,640 --> 04:08:06,660
I mean, it's still in here.

4658
04:08:06,800 --> 04:08:08,240
It hasn't bothered me in a while, though.

4659
04:08:08,360 --> 04:08:09,080
But I know it's in here.

4660
04:08:09,820 --> 04:08:10,180
Somewhere.

4661
04:08:10,460 --> 04:08:10,820
Lurking.

4662
04:08:10,980 --> 04:08:11,300
Waiting.

4663
04:08:11,740 --> 04:08:12,700
For its opportunity.

4664
04:08:13,500 --> 04:08:14,020
Got to go.

4665
04:08:14,140 --> 04:08:14,720
Thanks for the stream.

4666
04:08:14,980 --> 04:08:15,640
Good night, Chloe.

4667
04:08:16,060 --> 04:08:16,780
Have a good one.

4668
04:08:16,960 --> 04:08:17,540
Thanks for joining.

4669
04:08:21,200 --> 04:08:23,560
Oliver, who's the man committing all the crimes in your world?

4670
04:08:23,640 --> 04:08:24,340
And why is it Stuart?

4671
04:08:24,960 --> 04:08:28,400
I think it's Stuart and his disciples.

4672
04:08:29,260 --> 04:08:30,840
Because he's not just one man.

4673
04:08:30,980 --> 04:08:33,020
There's no way one man can do all that.

4674
04:08:33,580 --> 04:08:37,680
He definitely has a complicated network of people under his command.

4675
04:08:39,120 --> 04:08:40,100
I just know that.

4676
04:08:41,280 --> 04:08:44,240
And that's what the major crimes division is working on actively.

4677
04:08:44,560 --> 04:08:46,520
We're trying to get to the center of all this.

4678
04:08:46,620 --> 04:08:48,680
We can't go to court unless we have solid evidence.

4679
04:08:49,220 --> 04:08:53,720
So we're slowly and meticulously gathering all what we need, you know?

4680
04:08:57,780 --> 04:08:58,640
Jimmy's revenge?

4681
04:08:59,480 --> 04:09:00,800
Did Stuart send the fly?

4682
04:09:00,960 --> 04:09:01,160
Might.

4683
04:09:01,380 --> 04:09:02,020
Probably, man.

4684
04:09:03,240 --> 04:09:04,580
I don't know at this point.

4685
04:09:07,420 --> 04:09:09,040
But I know one thing for sure.

4686
04:09:10,040 --> 04:09:13,780
I know what happens in my kingdom, and crimes like that are not permitted.

4687
04:09:15,760 --> 04:09:18,080
Stuart does not belong here with his crimes.

4688
04:09:18,500 --> 04:09:21,160
He can choose to repent if he so wishes.

4689
04:09:22,460 --> 04:09:25,800
But I know he's working undercover with a bunch of people, and it's just not okay.

4690
04:09:28,680 --> 04:09:29,980
Please don't scare me for Halloween.

4691
04:09:29,980 --> 04:09:30,840
That would be terrifying.

4692
04:09:33,460 --> 04:09:34,700
That is my one...

4693
04:09:36,220 --> 04:09:43,060
The one thing I really love about living alone is that when I play a scary game, there's no fear of someone walking up behind me to scare me.

4694
04:09:43,920 --> 04:09:46,420
It's a real fear I have, because it would kill me.

4695
04:09:46,800 --> 04:09:48,460
It would absolutely murder me.

4696
04:09:52,270 --> 04:09:55,770
Remember episode one when you said that this was not a kingdom and you are not a king?

4697
04:09:55,910 --> 04:09:56,110
No.

4698
04:09:57,290 --> 04:09:58,430
I have never said that.

4699
04:10:01,540 --> 04:10:03,560
Does the solitude make you paranoid, though?

4700
04:10:03,720 --> 04:10:03,940
No.

4701
04:10:04,160 --> 04:10:04,600
Not really.

4702
04:10:05,140 --> 04:10:06,520
I embrace the solitude.

4703
04:10:07,060 --> 04:10:09,500
I'm definitely an indoorsy person.

4704
04:10:09,600 --> 04:10:10,080
What is it called?

4705
