I was about to say I'm an extravehicular person.

4706
04:10:14,400 --> 04:10:15,460
That doesn't make any fucking sense.

4707
04:10:15,580 --> 04:10:15,740
No, no.

4708
04:10:15,820 --> 04:10:17,320
I am an introvert.

4709
