4719
04:10:48,120 --> 04:10:48,880
Bundles go to me.

4720
04:10:50,560 --> 04:10:54,140
40 bushels every month on my desk.

4721
04:10:56,400 --> 04:10:59,620
But of course, when they pay me all that, we have a welfare state.

4722
04:10:59,860 --> 04:11:00,400
You know?

4723
