So obviously all those taxes go to improving the kingdom.

4724
04:11:03,780 --> 04:11:05,200
I will construct roads.

4725
04:11:05,420 --> 04:11:07,860
I will make buildings.

4726
04:11:08,100 --> 04:11:09,400
I will make everything great for people.

4727
04:11:09,660 --> 04:11:10,420
Free healthcare.

4728
04:11:10,680 --> 04:11:11,020
All that.

4729
04:11:11,440 --> 04:11:12,420
Free education.

4730
04:11:12,700 --> 04:11:13,620
People are gonna love it.

4731
04:11:14,620 --> 04:11:16,060
Oh, there's a bump in the road.

4732
04:11:16,200 --> 04:11:16,560
Fixed.

4733
04:11:17,280 --> 04:11:18,520
I come to the rescue.

4734
04:11:20,800 --> 04:11:21,800
Oliver's welfare.

4735
04:11:23,780 --> 04:11:25,260
84 diamonds gathered.

4736
04:11:25,660 --> 04:11:26,220
Yeah.

4737
04:11:27,840 --> 04:11:29,520
In record time as well.

4738
04:11:30,580 --> 04:11:33,120
That was within the first one and a half hours or something.

4739
04:11:33,340 --> 04:11:34,120
It was incredible.

4740
04:11:35,440 --> 04:11:36,300
Subsidized, you mean?

4741
04:11:37,540 --> 04:11:39,340
