But I also love dogs.

4748
04:11:51,300 --> 04:11:53,220
But in this game, I think the cats are cuter.

4749
04:11:54,400 --> 04:11:56,320
So I may love the cats more in this game.

4750
04:11:58,780 --> 04:11:59,920
