No!

4768
04:12:41,330 --> 04:12:43,110
That is not my favorite monster.

4769
04:12:44,190 --> 04:12:45,550
It's in fact very...

4770
04:12:45,550 --> 04:12:47,350
Very much on the bottom of that list.

4771
04:12:49,210 --> 04:12:50,730
Mine is probably the warden.

4772
