Oh shit!

4773
04:12:52,410 --> 04:12:52,910
That's right!

4774
04:12:52,910 --> 04:12:53,590
He exists!

4775
04:12:54,550 --> 04:12:56,370
Completely forgot about that entity.

4776
04:12:59,820 --> 04:13:00,540
